('1826.mp4', 'Animals: capybara. Objects: pizza float, sunglasses, drink, smartphone, swimming pool. Actions: relaxing, floating, lounging, sipping, holding. Emotions: leisure, contentment, relaxed. Scenes: summer, poolside, swimming pool. Concepts: relaxation, whimsy, leisure, vacation', 'Animals: capybara. Objects: pizza float, sunglasses, drink, smartphone, swimming pool. Actions: rela...', 'capybara, pizza float, sunglasses, drink, smartphone, swimming pool, relaxing, floating, lounging, sipping, holding, leisure, contentment, relaxed, summer, poolside, swimming pool, relaxation, whimsy, leisure, vacation', 'A capybara relaxes on a pizza-shaped float in a swimming pool, wearing red sunglasses. It holds a refreshing drink in one paw and a smartphone in the other, enjoying a leisurely day.', 'A capybara lounges on a pizza-shaped float in a swimming pool, sipping a drink with a slice of lime and holding a smartphone. The animal is wearing sunglasses, enjoying a sunny day in a relaxed manner.', NULL, '1080x1920', '9:16', 30.0, '5s'),
